commit 9c422bd224671a4ee0c6795223d0168debd4ca62 (HEAD -> yuxzhang/canon-zero-tim, origin/yuxzhang/canon-zero-tim)
Date:   Sun Aug 23 06:48:42 2026 +0000
    Add signed 300-step evaluation to P57 FrozenLake study
    Replace the ad hoc training schedule with a paired 300-update contract that evaluates a fixed held-out set at policy steps 0, 50, 100, 150, 200, 250, and 300. Add fail-closed seed and dataset receipts, an in-process evaluation classifier, renderer/profile propagation, CPU controls, and synchronized runbook/handoff guidance.
    The downside is seven rollout-only evaluation windows per arm and no byte-identical trajectory guarantee across launches because the backend lacks per-request seeds; comparisons therefore use the signed aggregate evaluation series. Background and launch instructions live under canon-zero-tim/tasks/p57-frozenlake-tim-causal-study/.
