69438:{"step_index":68773,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T03:03:21Z","content":"### 📊 Cluster Workload 实时状态报告 (Iteration 158)\n\n---\n\n### 1. 👑 DeepSWE Native Token-IS (128 TPU - `canon-p58-ds4b-native-is-full-p58f16`)\n\n* **训练进度**：**Step 57 / 100**（57.0%）\n* **核心指标**：\n  * **解决率 (Solve Rate)**：`25.8%`（历史波动区间 25.8% ~ 32.8%）\n  * **训练 Loss**：`0.0043`\n  * **单步耗时**：`441.9s`\n* **在轨动态**：正在并发进行 Group 456~463 的 SWE-bench 交互与 Rollout 采样，整体运行平稳健康。\n\n---\n\n### 2. 🎯 FrozenLake M15 Token-IS (64 TPU - `i15h`)\n\n* **进度**：**Step 150 / 300**（50.0%），保持 Idling 状态。\n\n---\n\n### 3. 🧪 诊断任务总结\n\n* **GSM8K P62 反向数值诊断**（64 TPU）：已完成，确证反向梯度全部有限（`all_finite: true`），无在轨训练任务。\n* **M15 APC Target-Debug Control**（64 TPU）：由于 `train_frozenlake_qwen3.py` 中遗留的 P38 DP16 几何硬编码与 DP8 目标参数冲突（`mini_batch_size: 32 vs 4`、`sampler_is: none vs token`）而在参数校验处退出，等待修复后重跑。\n\n---\n\n> 3 分钟定时轮询任务持续生效中，我将继续为您守候集群在轨工作负载。"}
69447:{"step_index":68782,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T03:03:44Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-25T03:03:44Z\nCompleted At: 2026-08-25T03:03:44Z\n\nThe command exited with code 0.\nOutput:\n<truncated 16 lines>\n{\"step_index\":68767,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-25T03:02:32Z\",\"content\":\"### 1. GSM8K 还在接着训练吗？\\n\\n**没有。**\\n* 刚才运行的是 **GSM8K P62 反向数值诊断任务**（`canon-p62-gsm8k-num-p62d3-505bfb95`，64 TPU、1 步单轮探测）。\\n* 该任务已**成功跑通并完成数值确证**（证实 Qwen3-1.7B 28 层反向梯度全部有限 `all_finite: true`，Attempt 7 的 `norm=inf` 为 Optax naive FP32 平方和溢出假阳性）。\\n* 诊断完成并完成指标落盘后，该任务按照预期的 `controlled exit 42` 正常结束退出。目前集群上没有在轨运行的 GSM8K 全量训练 JobSet。\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 2. M15 诊断的 Error Log 与异常原因\\n\\n#### 📌 错误现象\\n`canon-v1-apc-m15-off-d4-283cb67e` 在通过前 6 项 Overlay 校验及 GCS Preflight 后，进入 Step 90 启动阶段，Python 进程在连接 Pathways 后 0.2 秒触发 `exit=1` 退出。\\n\\n#### 🔍 精确代码根因（`train_frozenlake_qwen3.py` 几何校验不匹配）\\n在 [`examples/frozenlake/train_frozenlake_qwen3.py`](file:///usr/local/google/home/yuxzhang/yuxuan_dev/tunix_code_rl/canon-zero-tim/tunix/examples/frozenlake/train_frozenlake_qwen3.py#L536-L680) 中，存在之前为 P38 DP16 编写的硬编码几何断言，与当前 M15 APC Target-Debug（DP8xTP8）的参数发生冲突：\\n\\n1. **Mini-batch Size 冲突**（[L536](file:///usr/local/google/home/yuxzhang/yuxuan_dev/tunix_code_rl/canon-zero-tim/tunix/examples/frozenlake/train_frozenlake_qwen3.py#L536)）：\\n   ```python\\n   expected_mini_batch_size = 4 if CANON_P38_PRECHECK_ONLY else 32\\n   ```\\n   * 环境变量设置了 `CANON_P38_PRECHECK_ONLY=1`，导致代码期望 `mini_batch_size=4`；\\n   * 但 M15 目标参数传入的是 `--mini_batch_size=32`。\\n2. **Sampler IS 期望冲突**（[L580-L585](file:///usr/local/google/home/yuxzhang/yuxuan_de\n<truncated 1632 bytes>\ncalculates `p38_trajectories` if `CANON_P38_PRECHECK_ONLY` is true. This suggests the parameters impact batch size calculations if a pre-check process is active. The pre-check is focused on batch trajectory calculations.\\n\\n\\n**Analyzing Parameter Inconsistencies**\\n\\nThe code raises a `ValueError` due to a geometry mismatch, specifically between the configured batch size and expected value during a pre-check.  Further investigation shows that this error occurs because of an incorrect `P32_WORKLOAD.name` value. This is further complicated by the fact the trajectory count is not divisible by the DP size.\\n\\n\\n\"}\r\n{\"step_index\":68779,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-25T03:03:34Z\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"kubectl logs canon-p62-gsm8k-num-p62d3-505bfb95-pathways-head-0-0-hf2km -c jax-tpu\\\"\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\"/usr/local/google/home/yuxzhang/yuxuan_dev/tunix_code_rl/canon-zero-tim/tunix\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"10000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Getting P62 full logs from head pod\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Get P62 pod logs\\\"\"}}]}\r\n{\"step_index\":68780,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"GENERIC\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-25T03:03:36Z\",\"content\":\"Created At: 2026-08-25T03:03:36Z\\nCompleted At: 2026-08-25T03:03:37Z\\n\\nThe command exited with code 1.\\nOutput:\\nerror: error from server (NotFound): pods \\\"canon-p62-gsm8k-num-p62d3-505bfb95-pathways-head-0-0-hf2km\\\" not found in namespace \\\"default\\\"\\r\\n\\n\"}\r\n{\"step_index\":68781,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-25T03:03:37Z\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"grep -i \\\\\\\"canon-p62\\\\\\\" /usr/local/google/home/yuxzhang/.gemini/jetski/brain/94af9720-af95-4534-8f73-f43308cb7196/.system_generated/logs/transcript.jsonl | tail -n 20\\\"\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\"/usr/local/google/home/yuxzhang/yuxuan_dev/tunix_code_rl/canon-zero-tim/tunix\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"10000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Searching transcript for P62 logs\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Search transcript for P62\\\"\"}}]}\r\n\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
